1786046928018751	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuAQ		item.create	bn-3rv9	{"description":"Repro from console review cr-2xvvyg (seal 0.27.2): add web/engine.js to .sealignore, create a review whose target commit changes that generated minified file, then run 'seal diff <review> --format text'. The changed_files summary correctly omits web/engine.js, but the textual patch body still includes its ~2.1 MB minified Emscripten blob. This repeatedly exhausted reviewer context despite piping through head. Expected: ignored paths are excluded consistently from both changed_files metadata and the rendered diff payload. Add a regression covering a large ignored changed file and verify text/JSON/pretty output do not expose its patch.","kind":"bug","title":"Honor .sealignore in rendered review diff payload"}	blake3:0N9ADx-vCwi1a5GF9gKItSb_z66AHmXgsoty8Mr3P8U
