1786051153571884	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuBg		item.create	bn-t1rl	{"description":"Repro from console bn-rt0: a maw workspace contained an initial feature commit, eight conflict-resolution commits, and a final integration commit.  at the workspace tip persisted only the target;  chose target^ as base (d85170e), so review cr-2msjdn omitted the entire initial hook implementation and most conflict resolutions. The lead caught this before vote, abandoned the review, and squashed the workspace manually. Expected: review creation must support/persist an explicit base revision (e.g. --base), or reliably discover the workspace epoch/change base, so all commits in a feature range are reviewed. At minimum detect a multi-commit-ahead target and warn clearly rather than silently reviewing only HEAD^. Add Git and jj regressions for a three-commit feature whose first commit contains the substantive change; verify diff/status/review include the whole persisted range even after later commits or rewrites.","kind":"task","title":"Support complete multi-commit review ranges"}	blake3:W2taN9zL5kfkW5vhfEjTvvM3v7SKqVOEGlYH_g2ul7M
1786051178161556	console-dev	itc:v3:AWLmTP-ZOTJklAAAAAAAQe1v-11rVAAAAAEuBw		item.comment	bn-t1rl	{"body":"Exact commands in the repro: seal reviews create at the workspace tip and seal diff on the resulting review. The omitted range was e543bed through d85170e; only eee8710 was presented. Replacement review cr-2go1pd was created only after squashing the complete workspace delta onto epoch 25b8edb."}	blake3:Hj8ZWqXg-al6FUstAgK4XZHGahysbdUoXFcypEheKE4
