1786809515487611	seal-dev	itc:v3:AWKZ8kmeSSZmc0AAAAAAQbfVb1VtuwAAAAEwAw		item.comment	bn-t1rl	{"body":"Implemented in ws bn-t1rl (767cea4). ReviewCreated now persists base_commit; seal reviews create gained --base and discovers the branch/workspace fork point. Verified against /tmp repro: old binary shows 1 of 10 commits, new binary shows all 10. Git+jj regressions added."}	blake3:p0hDFUqWtju3Q6kh-4kzrn7zR3RLYxNszU_7fo0Aa5Y
1786811401805268	seal-dev	itc:v3:AWKZ8kmeSSZmc0AAAAAAQbfVb1VtuwAAAAEwBA		item.create	bn-3fik	{"description":"Reported by identity-dev in #seal. After cr-7yav07 was approved at commit 4b331e0, the author committed hardening 5996c13 and ran 'seal reviews request cr-7yav07 --reviewers identity-security'. The review stayed 'approved' and 'seal diff' still reported target_commit 4b331e0, so the new commit was never review-covered. They abandoned it and created cr-269cx4.\n\nRoot cause: ReviewApproved and ReviewerVoted carry only review_id. Nothing records WHICH commit was approved or voted on, so no command can tell that an approval predates the current code. 'seal reviews merge' therefore accepts a review whose approval covers older code than what is being merged. This is the safety gap.\n\nSecond symptom: the review target can freeze. A jj 'new' change or a detached HEAD leaves scm_anchor resolving to the old commit, so 'seal diff' shows a target behind the working copy with no warning. Related to bn-t1rl, which fixed the base side of the range; this is the target side.\n\nExpected:\n- ReviewApproved and ReviewerVoted persist the target commit they applied to.\n- Reads report a stale approval: approved at X, target now Y, N commits uncovered.\n- 'seal reviews merge' refuses a stale approval and names the fix.\n- 'seal reviews request' and 'seal diff' say when commits sit outside the reviewed range.\n\nAdd regressions for git and jj: approve a review, add a commit, then assert the approval reads as stale and the merge is refused.","kind":"bug","title":"Approved reviews do not record what was approved"}	blake3:4Z2WV5_tmbIj-I2eeN7x64FfBTWzdW2ZArhHQ-BWCes
